index cb060c6..fb3a08a 100644
--- a/README.md
+++ b/README.md
@@ -164,6 +164,17 @@ Projet open-source (licence à définir)
 
 **“Construire ensemble l’intelligence de demain.”**
 
+## Deploying with Turso on Vercel
+
+The app uses the local `.data/tlc.sqlite` file for development. On Vercel, it connects to a persistent Turso database instead.
+
+1. Create a Turso database and generate an authentication token in the Turso dashboard.
+2. Add `TURSO_DATABASE_URL` (the database URL) and `TURSO_AUTH_TOKEN` (the token) to the Vercel project's Production and Preview environment variables.
+3. Keep `ADMIN_PASSWORD` and `ADMIN_SESSION_SECRET` configured in Vercel as well.
+4. Redeploy. On its first request, the app creates the tables and seeds them from the JSON files in `data/`.
+
+For local development, leave the Turso variables unset to keep using `.data/tlc.sqlite`.
+
 
 pnpm dev      # Démarrer le serveur de développement
 pnpm build    # Compiler le projet
